   "beats": [
    "say: The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Catalina blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.",
    "say: 🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\"",
    "say: 📖 The Codex turns a page: Pallavi Surve, 58 days. The mantle passes to Catalina Reyes.",
    "say: 🪞 You wake up somebody else. Catalina Reyes, 38 — a fishing guide. Her hands know different work now: Game Sense, Patient Aim.",
    "say: At the grave, Joseph, Greta speak for Catalina — \"Pallavi trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.",
    "say: You catch fragments by the fire — David telling Fatima about you. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind.",
    "say: Sunlight on your skin. You drink it. +100 kcal. (photosynthesis)",
    "say: — NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.",
    "say: Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.",
    "say: The air thins a little. Someone nods at you by the fire. Maybe it blows over.",
    "say: The relief moment passes — the crisis runs its own course now. What you did stands; what you didn't, doesn't.",
    "say: You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."
   ],
